<title>FRANCE: Algeria sees one percent industry growth in 1997.</title>
<headline>Algeria sees one percent industry growth in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's industrial output is expected to grow by one percent next year, the Algerian news agency APS said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It quoted Finance Minister Abdelkrim Harchaoui as giving this estimate to the National Transitional Council.</p>
<p>APS said that industrial output fell 7.4 percent in the first half of 1996 compared with the same period last year.</p>
